## What We Are Building

A comprehensive file translation system with quality evaluation and iterative improvement. This session focused on Phase 7: Large File Handling, which adds intelligent chunking, parallel processing, and result merging for documents exceeding size thresholds (100+ pages or 50+ MB).

The system automatically detects large files, splits them into manageable chunks, processes chunks in parallel using ThreadPoolExecutor, and merges results with coherent quality across all sections. This is transparent to users - they simply upload a file and get results.

