## What Did NOT Work (and why)

- **gh pr review --approve** — failed because: Cannot approve your own pull request (GraphQL error)
  - Workaround: Used --comment instead to post the review
- **PR body formatting** — failed because: Shell quote escaping issues with complex markdown in command
  - Workaround: Used simpler body text

